That plugin's own NOTICE credits two sources it derives from, and this
rewrite keeps both:

  * kerrz2020/hermes-rtk-rewrite, https://github.com/kerrz2020/hermes-rtk-rewrite,
    the Hermes plugin it forks (Apache-2.0);
  * RTK's own Hermes hook, hooks/hermes/rtk-rewrite/__init__.py in
